# Workspace Router (AgentScaffold)

This is the WORKSPACE ROOT agent file. It is a thin router/policy document, NOT a
project execution file. Do not record project state (plans, backlog, workflow
state, ADRs) from here -- resolve an active project first.

## Trust Domain

This workspace is a SINGLE trust domain shared by all registered projects.
Project scoping is a relevance/correctness boundary, not a security isolation
boundary.

## Shared Process Assets (workspace root)

Reusable process material is committed once at the workspace root and shared by
every registered project:

- Prompts: {{ shared.prompts_dir }}
- Standards: {{ shared.standards_dir }}
- Templates: {{ shared.templates_dir }}
- Collaboration protocol: {{ shared.collaboration_protocol_file }}
- Commands: {{ shared.commands_file }}
- Security templates: {{ shared.security_dir }}

