## Active Project Resolution (Mandatory)

Resolve the active project from the working directory, an explicit `--project`
(CLI), or `working_path` (MCP). Do NOT write project artifacts (plans, backlog,
state, ADRs, contracts) without a selected project. When unsure, run
`scaffold workspace list`.

## Durability Taxonomy

- Commit: workspace shared process assets + each project's system of record.
- Gitignore: `.scaffold/` cache and personal overlays (`AGENTS.local.md`,
  `.cursor/rules/local.*.mdc`).
- Never untrack team `AGENTS.md` / platform routing rules to personalize --
  use `*.local` overlays instead.
